Review context: UI provider onboarding cleanup plus dead-code pass requested after Anthropic/Qwen implementation.

Scope and decisions:
- Configured provider cards no longer render a visible Connected row. The existing ValidateIcon, whose path matches grommet-icons--validate.svg, is positioned in green to the right of the provider logo while the card remains vertically centered. The accessible Connected label remains on the icon.
- Mistral and DeepSeek descriptions were made factual in all seven locales.
