Additional root-cause correction:
A targeted Rust run exposed a real test race: independent Anthropic/Qwen/Codex catalog tests replaced the same process-global runtime registry concurrently. All tests that mutate that registry now share one test-only async lock. Production registry behavior is unchanged.

